WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.980
How long have you been together?

2
00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:01.860
Three months.

3
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.020
Do you trust each other?

4
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:03.800
Yes. Yes.

5
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:09.400
Today we are doing a trust test: you have to swap phones for one minute and see whether you are faithful to each other.

6
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.480
Who will hand over their phone first?

7
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.420
I will. Come on.

8
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.840
The time starts now.

9
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.280
Okay, you went into Instagram.

10
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.020
I am looking at the messages, who you are writing to. Who is Milica?

11
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.580
That is his mother, that is his mother. Okay, that I believe.

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.360
Is it okay with you that they send him homework?

13
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.420
Yes, that is totally fine.

14
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.440
And why do you not help him with homework?

15
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.940
We do not go to the same school.

16
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:35.880
Hey, who is this?

17
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.840
Aha, I will not read that out loud.

18
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.060
So far it is okay. Go into WhatsApp.

19
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.020
I will check your Viber.

20
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.600
What? Nothing, nothing, nothing.

21
00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.360
You chat up girls on Viber?

22
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:51.660
No.

23
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.760
Which Anika? It is homework. Fine, I believe you.

24
00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.460
Every girl sends you homework.

25
00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.200
Well yes, homework has to be sent.

26
00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.840
You have five more seconds. Three, two, one.

27
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.780
Good, good. You did not find anything.

28
00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.340
So he is a good boyfriend. Yes, he is good.

29
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.040
Let us see whether you are good, give him the phone.

30
00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.280
You have one minute, the time starts now.

31
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.280
Let us see, he goes into Instagram. This is Veljko.

32
00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.260
Veljko, a friend. Okay, okay, this is a friend.

33
00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.720
Do you know that Veljko? No.

34
00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:20.840
How come he does not know him? I never mentioned him.

35
00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.720
And how are you writing to him now?

36
00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.660
I did not reply, I did not reply. You did not reply at all? Aha, then okay, then great.

37
00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.460
He asked me to go out, but I did not agree.

38
00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.520
Why did you not block him? I forgot.

39
00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.200
Let us look at WhatsApp, go in somewhere.

40
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:49.260
Lignoslav, who is Lignoslav? A forester. Jakša, who is Jakša?

41
00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.740
Two, one, done, time is up. You did not find anything, man.

42
00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.200
Are you still together? Yes. Yes.

43
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.000
Like this clip and follow me.
